# The repo had no .gitignore, so 1,337 untracked files -- 5.9 GB of run artifacts --
# sat in the root drowning `git status` and burying the 51 source files. None of it was
# ever tracked; it was just invisible to git and very visible to anyone using the repo.
#
# Everything below is REGENERATED from a config plus a checkpoint. Nothing here is a
# result that would be lost: the numbers that matter live in PLAN.md, and the artifacts
# can be rebuilt with score_checkpoints.py / eval_coverage.py.

# --- per-run artifacts, written to the cwd by the trainer and the scorers -------------
*_threshold_curve.json
*_confusion.json
*_coverage.json
*_confusion_raw.png
*_confusion_row_normalized.png
*_confusion_total_normalized.png
*_confusion_hybrid_row_normalized.png
*_threshold_curve_curve.png

# --- weights -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5.4 GB of these were loose in the root. Checkpoints belong in datasets/mix_ckpts/.
*.pth
*.ckpt

# --- the archive ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# tidy_experiments.py files finished artifacts here. Ignored wholesale EXCEPT the parts
# that are provenance rather than output:
#
#   configs_frozen/  the handful of inputs the campaign depends on -- the anchor config
#                    (with its calibrated gate), the inference benches, and above all
#                    val_coverage_frames.json, which DEFINES the coverage carve-out. Both
#                    boxes must use a byte-identical copy of that file or their coverage
#                    numbers are not comparable, so it belongs in git.
#   configs_runs/    one config per training run: the recipe behind every number in
#                    PLAN.md. 55 files, 356K.
#
# Everything else here -- weights, plots, curves, confusion matrices -- is regenerable
# from a config plus a checkpoint and stays ignored.
experiments/*
!experiments/README.md
!experiments/configs_frozen/
!experiments/configs_runs/
!experiments/zoo_sweep_manifest.tsv
!experiments/protocol_changelog.md

# --- exported deployment bundles -----------------------------------------------------
# 5.1 GB of timestamped .zip exports. models/PLACEHOLDER stays tracked so the directory
# survives a clone.
models/*.zip

# --- symlink to the storage array, not repo content ----------------------------------
/datasets

# --- bench scratch under scripts/ ----------------------------------------------------
scripts/*.txt
scripts/*.txt.[0-9]
scripts/*.csv
scripts/*.png
scripts/*.bak

# --- scratch -------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.json.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tensorboard/

# --- generated per-run model configs --------------------------------------------------
# One config per training run, emitted by seed_replicates.py / model_sweep.py /
# full_zoo_sweep.py / pfc_variance.py. These are the same class of file being removed from
# the repo root upstream, and the trainer rewrites them in place after each run (appending
# confusion_matrix, gate, model_md5), so they are outputs as much as inputs. Archived under
# experiments/configs_runs/ instead.
/ms*_*.json
/fz*_*.json
/pfc4s*_*.json
/anc1337_*.json
/anc7_*.json
/ancs21337_*.json
/ancs27_*.json
/ancs2_convnext_pico.json
/zoo_inference_bench.json
